  49:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton_caches_interface.h ****    * @note the address range should fulfill alignment constraints with respect to the MCU cache lin
  50:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton_caches_interface.h ****    *       for both its `address` & `size` (to better correspond to what this operation will actual
  51:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton_caches_interface.h ****    * @note this function is intended to handle the case where a buffer has been filled by the MCU/p
  52:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton_caches_interface.h ****    *       passing thru the MCU cache) and should be called AFTER that the buffer has been filled
  53:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton_caches_interface.h ****    */
  54:../../Middlewares/stedgeai-lib/Npu/ll_aton/ll_aton_caches_interface.h ****   static inline void LL_ATON_Cache_MCU_Clean_Range(uintptr_t virtual_addr, uint32_t size)
